      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "解释有意令56÷8暂取错商6，再用6×8=48识别少一组8，并明确商应修正为7。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/m2a.5.4.json",
      "pointer": "/objective_coverage/1/explanation",
      "statement": "乘法检查需返回原来的被除数。例如56÷8=6若检查6×8=48，就能发现还少一组8，应把商改为7。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef6609544a5ce257f71316a5433dfbbb97ec8aec162ad619165af88034fc8c20",
      "source_sha256": "d1b564105e5ed9292a9694c76b977c2fba7c7f8fc5ad178f63a2bfbda94ef7b9",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "修订提示同时列正确35和错误45，要求比较加法验算；45+28=73不等于63，故45是被批判的反例。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/m2b.4.3.json",
      "pointer": "/objective_coverage/1/difficulty_support/revision_prompt",
      "statement": "对63−28=35写加法验算，再对错误结果63−28=45做同样检查指出矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b190b0df5b97ecdc8e66aa7410b3b6177a7ba37a78c2ba4c659363f675cb3557",
      "source_sha256": "4c684d64f2674e254b7b66e75e4e973e6d8c250f3a1b32309de733c4fb1d2ec2",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "要求指出分母直接相加的错误；六等分单位保持不变，正确1/6+2/6=3/6=1/2。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/m3a.6.5.json",
      "pointer": "/objective_coverage/1/difficulty_support/revision_prompt",
      "statement": "指出1/6+2/6=3/12错在哪里，画六等分条修正，并解释分母为何保持6。"
    },
    {
      "id": "793ac29e986201a7311a55290bf50448fee54e95b34e38896b6a46ca9ed192ac",
      "source_sha256": "0e6cf8f614c906e9f65556dc5e81f9fbf1ebf0777da847328df44a0f414f5a2b",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "此项位于易错点，展示错误相加分子分母。通分得3/6+2/6=5/6，而非2/5。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/m5b.3.1.json",
      "pointer": "/pitfalls/0",
      "statement": "分母直接相加：1/2+1/3=2/5。"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6c48d1ab73dcd5fa1e378833e742530e64c130a4da40bfd597ac2590a6fbeb0",
      "source_sha256": "c968da8e1373b4804d8828d0fa85d5053a1b7e6f28927aefad9b29f5ded60fbc",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "0=1被明确称为矛盾，用于解释直线方程组无解与无交点的对应关系。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/mh3.2.3.1.json",
      "pointer": "/why",
      "statement": "方程的解集就是直线，联立表示取两个解集的交集。消元若得到一个确定坐标，说明方向不同；若得到矛盾如0=1则无交点，若只余恒等式则两约束等价。因而代数解的个数与几何位置一一对应。"
    },
    {
      "id": "06558ca542145f8a79d0e4e0333e9605486decfd263313ec92c93faf3b5fbc63",
      "source_sha256": "c968da8e1373b4804d8828d0fa85d5053a1b7e6f28927aefad9b29f5ded60fbc",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "倍乘第一式后与第二式相减得到0=2这一矛盾，据此判无解且平行；不把矛盾当真等式。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/teach/mh3.2.3.1.json",
      "pointer": "/objective_coverage/1/self_check/reference_answer",
      "statement": "第一式乘2为2x+4y=6，与第二式相减得0=2，无解，所以两线平行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c457b1dacc78aa02a1a04e978f0d36cc368e761dc7952cbd96eb6c5578c6dd7",
      "source_sha256": "787edc3703fb2cae6ea5b53c8d20bb284b8426db2356c73c543a5ae4a770cad5",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "从0×2=0×3两边除以0是不合法操作；2=3为指出非法除法导致的矛盾，正文明确禁止。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/learning_units/equation_equivalence.json",
      "pointer": "/explanation/counterexample",
      "statement": "从0×2=0×3不能两边除以0推出2=3。类似地，解2x=0时不能直接除以可能为0的x，否则会丢掉真正的解x=0。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6366c196c50570bbccb05e6b07fbe6b9d94e7b7526c5cd63d4a968992259001",
      "source_sha256": "787edc3703fb2cae6ea5b53c8d20bb284b8426db2356c73c543a5ae4a770cad5",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "6=7是化简后不可能成立的条件，正文据此判方程无解，与恒等式0=0作对照。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/learning_units/equation_equivalence.json",
      "pointer": "/tasks/9/explanation",
      "statement": "①化简为0=0，对所有实数x成立；②化简为6=7，不可能成立，所以无解。此时不是普通的非零系数一次方程，不能用除以0得到唯一解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f891f39903d37222234f6a66bb9ede50027d0ad383b2c14529499b3d4f1cdf6",
      "source_sha256": "787edc3703fb2cae6ea5b53c8d20bb284b8426db2356c73c543a5ae4a770cad5",
      "decision": "intentional_counterexample",
      "reason": "3x+2=3x+4化为2=4，明确作无解例子，与2=2恒等式区分，不授予错误等式成立。",
      "reviewer_kind": "ai",
      "teacher_review": "pending",
      "path": "data/learning_units/equation_equivalence.json",
      "pointer": "/instructional_support/supports/5/hints/2/text",
      "statement": "3x+2=3x+2化为2=2，对所有实数成立；3x+2=3x+4化为2=4，无解。唯一解也要代回原式而非只查最后一步。"
    }
  ]
